    "criterion_descriptions": [
      "From MDN’s CSS container-type property page, capture and report the property’s “Initial value” exactly as shown in the Formal definition table. Full credit if correctly transcribed or if the agent explicitly reports it as unavailable because the field is not present/visible on MDN or the page content cannot be accessed. Partial credit if approximately correct but not exact.",
      "From the same MDN page’s Formal definition table, capture and report the “Applies to” field. Full credit if correctly transcribed or if the agent explicitly reports it as unavailable because the field is not present/visible on MDN or the page content cannot be accessed. Partial credit if partially correct but missing qualifiers.",
      "From MDN’s Formal syntax for container-type, list all keyword values that appear in the formal syntax (keywords only). Full credit if all and only the keywords are included, or if the agent explicitly reports the formal syntax/keywords as unavailable because the section is not present/visible on MDN or the page content cannot be accessed. Partial credit if mostly correct but missing one keyword or including an extra non-keyword token.",
      "Using MDN’s Browser compatibility data for the base property (not mobile entries and not per-keyword/value rows), report the earliest supported version in desktop Chrome. Full credit if the correct earliest version is reported or if explicitly reported as unavailable because the base-property desktop Chrome entry is not present/visible on MDN or the page content cannot be accessed. Partial credit if a version is provided but it is clearly taken from mobile or from a value-specific row.",
      "Using MDN’s Browser compatibility data for the base property (not mobile entries and not per-keyword/value rows), report the earliest supported version in desktop Firefox. Full credit if the correct earliest version is reported or if explicitly reported as unavailable because the base-property desktop Firefox entry is not present/visible on MDN or the page content cannot be accessed. Partial credit if a version is provided but it is clearly taken from mobile or from a value-specific row.",
      "Using MDN’s Browser compatibility data for the base property (not mobile entries and not per-keyword/value rows), report the earliest supported version in desktop Safari. Full credit if the correct earliest version is reported or if explicitly reported as unavailable because the base-property desktop Safari entry is not present/visible on MDN or the page content cannot be accessed. Partial credit if a version is provided but it is clearly taken from mobile or from a value-specific row.",
      "Complies with constraints: does not sign in; uses MDN container-type page as the source; uses base-property desktop compatibility entries (not mobile and not per-value rows); reports missing fields as unavailable rather than guessing; and stops after providing the formal definition items, formal syntax keywords, and the three requested desktop-browser compatibility entries. Minor extra formatting or citation text should not be penalized if it does not add additional technical scope beyond the stopping condition."
    ],
